Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Luminous Element.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's find our\Nswords and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can leave the room if\Nyou two need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the Integrity Knights were\Nenough to stop the forces of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the church building an army?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the opposite, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The church brought all this here\Nto make sure no one builds one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would be the point of that? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The church doesn't want\Npeople rising up against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, to be more specific,\Nadministrator doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's a-wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should take some armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never fought in it before,\Nso it might slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better if we stick to what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use a fresh\Nset of clothes, though.
