Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First element!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, you hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no typical spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect weapon control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bow's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy hell, I wonder what it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.93,0:05:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have bigger things to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I last bathed in the Conflagration\NBow's fire two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I summon the fire again\Nto deal with you sinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the skills to match Sir Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what you did to him is unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of fighting\Nlike knights with honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you corrupted his mind and led\Nhim astray with the dark arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What it was, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, sir knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we did was remind him of his\Nlife before he became a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knights do not have a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:06:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have always been integrity knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our existence begins when we...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are summoned from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should burn you criminals to ash,\Nbut my orders are to capture you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I have unleashed\Nthe conflagration bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, one of your arms will\Nmost likely be incinerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bow's gonna do serious damage now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling he can't\Nrapid-fire with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm lucky and block the\Nfirst shot, you charge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate cryogenic element!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance! Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not toy with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to think about what\Nyou're putting behind your strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I should\Nput behind mine, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something you're gonna\Nhave to figure out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here for her, and\Nnothing will stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Rose Sword, lend me your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, give me the\Nstrength to keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you're cold and sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forged since creation by freezing cold\Nblizzards at the top of the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let these weak flames
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,melt, you, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that first skill\Nyou used, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's of the Aincrad style, a\Ntwo-hit strike, vertical arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A two-hit strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was your skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, are you okay? Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I healed the worst burns myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Aincrad 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.91,0:11:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the defense skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Spinning Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I had seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been from one end of this\Nrealm to the other, and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, there are styles I've never\Nseen, and skills I've never encountered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell there is\Nmuch discipline in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you have spent years\Nof training in your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I accused you of using the\Ndark arts to corrupt Ser Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know now that I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be honored to know your names.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito the swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the 50th floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the great hall of ghostly light,\NIntegrity Knights wait, should you pass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will not take you prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have orders to\Nextinguish your lives instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you charge them head-on\Nlike you did me just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will most certainly meet your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed to carry out\NAdministrator's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:13:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be stripped of my armor and\Ndivine object, the proof of my knighthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I shall be frozen for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not wish to suffer their indignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I want you to end my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no need to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you defeated me fairly,\Nusing your splendid skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, my name is\NDeusolbert Synthesis 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...Deus Albert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo, you're the one who took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fair battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dignity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to die with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where was your honor when you\Nchained up an 11-year-old girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tied her to your\Ndragon and took her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dying with honor is too good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.27,0:14:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't kill a defenseless person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he came to my village and took Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the church messes\Nwith these guys' heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he remembers being in\NRulid, or taking Alice away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is as your companion says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never kidnap a child,\Nmuch less chain them to my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, I do not remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened eight years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, I mean Tiese Elbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight years ago, you were guarding\Nthe border of North Norlinggarth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,District 7 in North Norlinggarth was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to patrol the borderlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, until eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the church rewarded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I received this armor, and was given\Nthe duty to guard the central cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what the\Nchurch rewarded you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were on a mission to steal his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's called Alice Synthesis 30 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you brought her back here,\NAdministrator rewarded you all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She also erased your\Nmemory of what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because she can't have\Nyou remembering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.23,0:16:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told us before that\NIntegrity Knights have no past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lives begin when you're summoned\Nfrom heaven, but that's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something the Pontifex tells all\Nthe Knights, right after they come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To help explain why\Nnone of you can remember
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything before becoming\Nan Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want you to have\Nany memories, not even one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:17:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she doesn't stop with the\Nmemories of your human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She takes the ones you\Nhave of other knights, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones you brought to her to get turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a sinner you brought\Nin for judgment showed up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a knight the next day\Nand you remembered them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there'd be chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I would remember. I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Administrator\Nstole your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, she forced\Nabsolute loyalty on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she turned you into a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're human, just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And having my memory manipulated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the Pontifex?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absurd. No, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the one who is mistaken here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, try to remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet there's an image or a feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something so precious to\Nyou, no art can erase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the time I first ascended,\NI keep having the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A delicate hand shaking me awake,\Nand on one finger, a silver ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I do wake up,\Nthere's no one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever that hand belongs to\Nis someone special to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Administrator stole your memory of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you do next is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go back to Administrator\Nand accept your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you can heal yourself\Nand come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All these stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How far up are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next floor is the 29th.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the rate we're going, we'll reach\Nthe 50th floor in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we just charge in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After seeing how that last\Ndude fought, I got a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combo attacks seem to\Nthrow these knights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they never had\Na deal with them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's one-on-one and we could get\Nup close, I think we'd have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that knight said there's a bunch\Nup there and they're ready for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's going to make things harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.23,0:19:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.17,0:19:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find another way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cardinal said these stairs\Nwere the only way up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we're going to have to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we did find a way around, we'd\Nhave to face them on the way back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should deal with those knights now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new special skill should help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect weapon control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we use it when we charge in, we\Ncan take a bunch out before they can react.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With any luck, our first\Nstrike will get them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we should talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll be much help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My version of perfect\Nweapon control isn't a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,direct attack like that\NIntegrity Knights was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not based on the command\NCardinal wrote for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess in the end\Nit's my fault for imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me check it out and\Nsee what's up with it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might not be quick enough\Nfor a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, it should come in handy\Nas long as you use it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, it looks like it complements\Nmy perfect control art.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I see what yours is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't want to spoil the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We see you. Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're children.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
